<title>USA: Micros Systems Q4 June shr down to $0.38.</title>
<headline>Micros Systems Q4 June shr down to $0.38.</headline>
<dateline>BELTSVILLE, Md 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.38		    $0.43</p>
<p> Net		 3,044		    3,437</p>
<p> Revs		55,496		   35,239</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  7,969		    7,954</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.30		    $1.46</p>
<p> Net		 2,392		    11,577</p>
<p> Revs		178,049		  112,021</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary8,006		    7,957</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Full company name is MICROS Systems inc.</p>
<p>Fiscal year ended June 30, 1996.</p>
<p>1996 Q4 net income lower due to higher expenses of acquired operations, higher tax rate, increased interest expense incurred from debt used to purchase Fidelio Software GmbH.</p>
<p>1996 fiscal year revenues total $144.7 million excluding revenues from acquired Fidelio Software GmbH.</p>
<p>1996 fiscal year income lower due to one-time, after tax charge of $8.1 million or $1.01 share for purchase of software technology from Fidelio.</p>
